layer":"original","quote":"峻说原曰：“董卓首乱，天下莫不侧目，然而未有先发者；非无其心也，势未敢耳。明府若能倡之，必有和者","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":41,"end":89},{"id":"rensu-q-43947211755a56503814","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c5d90173c0d1401060d9","layer":"original","quote":"峻又别收宗族及宾客家兵数百人，愿从太祖","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":34,"end":53},{"id":"rensu-q-4cbcb063175f67fb0f74","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-e04a88325a01db0dc84a","layer":"original","quote":"官渡之战，太祖使峻典军器粮运","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":79,"end":93},{"id":"rensu-q-4de9a4a5a8d39491e9dd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-a79f4ce402383d870edc","layer":"original","quote":"文帝追录功臣，谥峻曰成侯；复以峻中子览，为关内侯","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":28,"end":52},{"id":"rensu-q-5a22a588ad3eef4bd3c5","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-a79f4ce402383d870edc","layer":"original","quote":"建安九年，薨。太祖流涕者久之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"rensu-q-6f13f8772a40d6cda6bf","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-20ebda5a84dbc493ab20","layer":"original","quote":"原从其计，以峻为主簿","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":147,"end":157},{"id":"rensu-q-9eb4d4da4de0cdaf841e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-07ce76d8872f33914287","layer":"original","quote":"于饥荒之际，收恤朋友孤遗〖9〗，中外贫宗，周急继乏，信义见称","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":48,"end":78},{"id":"rensu-q-ada39e85b3ab18181989","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-e04a88325a01db0dc84a","layer":"original","quote":"乃使千乘为一部〖6〗，十道方行〖7〗；为复阵以营卫之〖8〗，贼不敢近","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":103,"end":137},{"id":"rensu-q-dd932a23defcb7b36cad","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c5d90173c0d1401060d9","layer":"original","quote":"峻独与同郡张奋议，举郡以归太祖","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":33},{"id":"rensu-q-ea47dfe7d7723f5544c6","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-20ebda5a84dbc493ab20","layer":"original","quote":"峻乃为原表行尹事，使诸县坚守，遂发兵","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":158,"end":176},{"id":"rensu-q-f154817d23b9d557195a","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-e04a88325a01db0dc84a","layer":"original","quote":"募百姓屯田于许下〖5〗，得谷百万斛；郡国列置田官。〕数年中，所在积粟，仓廪皆满","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":39,"end":78},{"id":"rensu-q2-38933ad3a515c9442000","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c5d90173c0d1401060d9","layer":"original","quote":"会太祖起关东，入中牟界；众不知所从。峻独与同郡张奋议，举郡以归太祖。峻又别收宗族及宾客家兵数百人，愿从太祖。太祖大悦，表峻为骑都尉；妻以从妹〖3〗，甚见亲信。太祖每征伐，峻常居守，以给军。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94},{"id":"rensu-q2-6c15e5d062f7eb0abacd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-a79f4ce402383d870edc","layer":"original","quote":"建安九年，薨。太祖流涕者久之。子先嗣。先薨，无子，国除。文帝追录功臣，谥峻曰成侯；复以峻中子览，为关内侯。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53},{"id":"rensu-q2-8d0021100f87fc3b2fc1","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-07ce76d8872f33914287","layer":"original","quote":"太祖以峻功高，乃表封为都亭侯，邑三百户，迁长水校尉。峻宽厚有度，而见事理；每有所陈，太祖多善之。于饥荒之际，收恤朋友孤遗〖9〗，中外贫宗，周急继乏，信义见称。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79},{"id":"wudi-e-p046a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-600f0712576696865299","layer":"pei","quote":"是岁，乃募民屯田许下，得谷百万斛。于是州郡例置田官，所在积谷；","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-50452beeb3e13bec2fd1","start":137,"end":168},{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
